      "title": "The last stand",
      "text": "In the morning the Greeks went out into the wider part of the pass to fight, and Leonidas fell. When the Persians who had come round by the path appeared behind them, they fell back behind the wall onto the hillock at the entrance, and were overwhelmed from front and rear.",
